miscalibrated lane from its log rather than its findings", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "adversarial_review_trio", "label": "Adversarial review trio: prosecution, defence, adjudicator", "nodes": ["user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_prosecution_reviewer_ultra_prosecution", "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_defence_reviewer_ultra_defence", "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_adjudicator_reviewer_ultra_adjudicator", "user__claude_agents_reviewer_ultra_adjudicator_adversarial_reconciliation"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "user/.claude/agents/reviewer-ultra-adjudicator.md"}]}